{"id":"f7fe6d0b50ba7f69","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md","title":"ZFC Pcf3 Pcf Spectrum","display":"df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum — ZFC Pcf3 Pcf Spectrum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum — ZFC Pcf3 Pcf Spectrum","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-hartogs-number.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum — ZFC Pcf3 Pcf Spectrum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a32c3b00cffaa99\" href=\"?note=5a32c3b00cffaa99\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4dad079dff660754\" href=\"?note=4dad079dff660754\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-hartogs-number.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-hartogs-number.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,S,h,U,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(A,S,h,U,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span>（正则基数谓词）与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上的超滤谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S\\)</span> (true-cofinality predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HartogsNumber}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HartogsNumber}_S\\)</span> (Hartogs-number predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4dad079dff660754\" href=\"?note=4dad079dff660754\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-hartogs-number.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-hartogs-number.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(A,S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists h\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HartogsNumber}_S(h,\\prod A)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land S=\n\\{\\lambda\\in h:\\exists U\\;\n(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S\n(A,\\mathcal P(A)\\setminus U,\\lambda))\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(A,S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists h\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HartogsNumber}_S(h,\\prod A)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land S=\n\\{\\lambda\\in h:\\exists U\\;\n(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S\n(A,\\mathcal P(A)\\setminus U,\\lambda))\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\)</span> uses ultrafilter quotients; the dual ideal is explicitly <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(A)\\setminus U\">\\(\\mathcal P(A)\\setminus U\\)</span>, rather than an arbitrary proper ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The Hartogs bound turns the spectrum into a set-separated subclass of an ordinal, while the carrier guard requires a nonempty set of regular cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a32c3b00cffaa99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-hartogs-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"4dad079dff660754","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-hartogs-number.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-hartogs-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"4dad079dff660754","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HartogsNumber}_S$ (Hartogs-number predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-hartogs-number.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,S,h,U,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HartogsNumber}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(A,S)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists h\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HartogsNumber}_S(h,\\prod A)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land S=\n\\{\\lambda\\in h:\\exists U\\;\n(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S\n(A,\\mathcal P(A)\\setminus U,\\lambda))\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(A)\\setminus U","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1682,"backlinks":[{"id":"1ae6d4638a7863b4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../b